---
import { appPath, CORPORATE_URL } from '../lib/urls';

const loginUrl = appPath('/login');
---

<footer class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-t-[3rem] bg-[#0c0a12] pt-20 pb-10 text-slate-400">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -left-32 top-0 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-violet-600/15 blur-[100px]"></div>
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-32 bottom-0 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-rose-500/10 blur-[100px]"></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 md:px-8">
    <div class="animate-on-scroll slide-up mb-16 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-white md:text-4xl">SNS運用を、次のレベルへ。</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-base text-white/50">
        複雑な運用はAIに任せ、あなたは本業に集中するだけ。
      </p>
      <a
        href={loginUrl}
        class="mt-8 inline-flex rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-500 to-rose-500 px-10 py-4 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-violet-500/25 transition-all hover:brightness-110"
      >
        無料アカウントを作成
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-10 border-t border-white/10 pt-12 md:grid-cols-5">
      <div class="col-span-2">
        <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-500 to-rose-500 text-sm font-bold text-white">B</span>
          <span class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white">BuzzIt</span>
        </div>
        <p class="max-w-xs text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/45">
          SNSを伸ばすだけでなく、組織を動かし、売上をつくる経営OS。BtoC店舗のための次世代SaaS。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="mb-4 text-sm font-bold text-white">Product</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm">
          <li><a href="#features" class="transition-colors hover:text-violet-300">機能一覧</a></li>
          <li><a href="#pricing" class="transition-colors hover:text-violet-300">料金プラン</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="mb-4 text-sm font-bold text-white">Company</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm">
          <li><a href={CORPORATE_URL} class="transition-colors hover:text-violet-300">会社概要</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="mb-4 text-sm font-bold text-white">Legal</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm">
          <li><span class="text-white/40">利用規約（準備中）</span></li>
          <li><span class="text-white/40">プライバシー（準備中）</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-white/10 pt-8 text-xs md:flex-row">
      <p>© 2026 株式会社シゴトク. All rights reserved.</p>
      <div class="flex gap-5">
        <a href="#" class="transition-colors hover:text-white" aria-label="X">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="transition-colors hover:text-white" aria-label="Instagram">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2.163c3.204 0 3.584.012 4.85.07 3.252.148 4.771 1.691 4.919 4.919.058 1.265.069 1.645.069 4.849 0 3.205-.012 3.584-.069 4.849-.149 3.225-1.664 4.771-4.919 4.919-1.266.058-1.644.07-4.85.07-3.204 0-3.584-.012-4.849-.07-3.26-.149-4.771-1.699-4.919-4.92-.058-1.265-.07-1.644-.07-4.849 0-3.204.013-3.583.07-4.849.149-3.227 1.664-4.771 4.919-4.919 1.266-.057 1.645-.069 4.849-.069zm0-2.163c-3.259 0-3.667.014-4.947.072-4.358.2-6.78 2.618-6.98 6.98-.059 1.281-.073 1.689-.073 4.948 0 3.259.014 3.668.072 4.948.2 4.358 2.618 6.78 6.98 6.98 1.281.058 1.689.072 4.948.072 3.259 0 3.668-.014 4.948-.072 4.354-.2 6.782-2.618 6.979-6.98.059-1.28.073-1.689.073-4.948 0-3.259-.014-3.667-.072-4.947-.196-4.354-2.617-6.78-6.979-6.98-1.281-.059-1.69-.073-4.949-.073zm0 5.838c-3.403 0-6.162 2.759-6.162 6.162s2.759 6.163 6.162 6.163 6.162-2.759 6.162-6.163c0-3.403-2.759-6.162-6.162-6.162zm0 10.162c-2.209 0-4-1.79-4-4 0-2.209 1.791-4 4-4s4 1.791 4 4c0 2.21-1.791 4-4 4zm6.406-11.845c-.796 0-1.441.645-1.441 1.44s.645 1.44 1.441 1.44c.795 0 1.439-.645 1.439-1.44s-.644-1.44-1.439-1.44z"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
